Hi all

TI has launched open source based OMAP Linux portal at http://omapzoom.org/gf/

The portal hosts most up-to-date OMAP System Software for use of community.
The components included are Kernel, dsp-bridge, bootloader, multimedia (OMX-source and DSP firmware binaries). Refer http://omapzoom.org/gf/project/ for more details.

This kernel GIT is a clone from linux-omap git and you will get more details at the project wiki http://omapzoom.org/gf/project/omapkernel/wiki

The same mailing list <linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org> can be used for discussions.
I will be the point of contact for any queries, discussions or patches.

